# Everything a build stage should fetch or produce for itself, plus everything
# that must never enter an image layer.
#
# Note the shape of the Dockerfiles: manifests are copied first so the install
# layer caches, then sources. That only works if a stale local `node_modules` or
# `dist` can't ride along and shadow the copy.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets. `.env.example` is the documented shape and is safe to carry.
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local state and tooling that has no business in an image.
.git
.github
.cache
.claude
.claudeignore
.devcontainer
.pnpm-store
.postgres-data
.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Docs and working notes: large, and read by people rather than by the build.
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Playwright/probe output.
tools/perf-probe/output
